Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value TRUST_STATE (\S+)
Value RATE_PPS (\S+)
Value BURST_INTERVAL (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Interface\s+Trust\s+State\s+Rate\s+\(pps\)\s+Burst\s+Interval\s*$$ -> Table
  ^.*$$

Table
  ^\s*-+\s+-+\s+-+\s+-+\s*$$
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${TRUST_STATE}\s+${RATE_PPS}\s+${BURST_INTERVAL}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^.*$$
